  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action and Support to Avert, Minimise and Address Displacement Related with the Adverse Impacts of Climate Change in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The interventions are focused on building a data ecosystem relating to displacement, including methodological pilots and initiatives to strengthen government capacity to collect and utilize data, Interventions also include undertaking policy analysis, stocktaking existing interventions, integrating displacement considerations in local level planning, protecting rights of displaced populations, research and evidence, and enhancing relocation efforts. Addressing country priorities, these activities contribute to the global project objectives of improved knowledge development, risk assessment, preparedness and integrated planning.</narrative>
  </description>
